  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;HEALTH EDUCATION AND TRAINING INSTITUTE (HETI)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"HETI is a prestigious institution known for excellence in education, where Louise Stone made significant contributions during her tenure."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOUISE STONE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Louise Stone is a dedicated researcher whose work significantly impacted the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI), marked by her academic achievements and collaborations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARRAMATTA, AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Parramatta, Australia is the city where the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI) is located, known for its rich cultural heritage and vibrant community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HARVARD MEDICAL SCHOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Harvard Medical School is a renowned institution where Louise Stone worked as a researcher in the field of neurology, conducting experiments and pushing the boundaries of human understanding."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. RACHEL LEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Rachel Lee is a distinguished faculty member at the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI) who collaborated with Louise Stone on research projects."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. RACHEL PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Rachel Patel is a trusted colleague of Louise Stone at the Neuroregeneration Lab at Harvard Medical School, working on experiments and research projects."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. ERIC THOMPSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Eric Thompson is the department chair at Harvard Medical School who collaborates with Louise Stone on research projects and discussions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Eric Thompson is the department chair who stops by to discuss the upcoming symposium on neuroplasticity with Louise."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN HEALTH EDUCATION CONFERENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Australian Health Education Conference is an event where Louise Stone presented a seminal paper on innovative pedagogies in health education."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEUROREGENERATION LAB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Neuroregeneration Lab is a research facility at Harvard Medical School where Dr. Rachel Patel and Louise Stone conduct their experiments and research projects."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATIVE PEDAGOGIES IN HEALTH EDUCATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Innovative Pedagogies in Health Education is the title of a paper co-authored by Louise Stone and Dr. Rachel Lee, presented at the 2018 Australian Health Education Conference."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CURRICULUM DESIGN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Curriculum Design refers to the process of creating educational programs and materials, which Louise Stone is skilled in, as evidenced by her co-authored paper."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDUCATIONAL TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Educational Technology involves the use of technology in teaching and learning, which is highlighted in Louise Stone's co-authored paper."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEUROLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Neurology is the medical specialty concerned with the diagnosis and treatment of diseases of the nervous system, which is Louise Stone's area of expertise at Harvard Medical School."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEUROPLASTICITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Neuroplasticity is the brain's ability to change and adapt, which is the focus of the upcoming symposium discussed by Dr. Eric Thompson and Louise Stone."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neuroplasticity is the topic of the upcoming symposium, indicating the focus of Louise's and Dr. Thompson's discussion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FREEDOM OF INFORMATION REQUESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Freedom of Information requests were used to obtain internal memoranda and meeting minutes that establish Louise Stone's affiliation with the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC PUBLICATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic Publications are the research outputs of Louise Stone and her colleagues at the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH PROJECTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research Projects are the collaborative efforts of Louise Stone and her colleagues at the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI) and Harvard Medical School."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC COMMITTEES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic Committees are the groups where Louise Stone participated in meetings and discussions at the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPERIMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Experiments are the research activities conducted by Louise Stone and her colleagues at the Neuroregeneration Lab at Harvard Medical School."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LATE NIGHTS, EARLY MORNINGS, AND ENDLESS CUPS OF COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Late Nights, Early Mornings, and Endless Cups of Coffee represent the dedication and hard work of Louise Stone and her colleagues in their research endeavors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH COLLABORATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research Collaborations are the partnerships formed by Louise Stone and her colleagues at the Health Education and Training Institute (HETI) and Harvard Medical School."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC ACHIEVEMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic Achievements are the accomplishments of Louise Stone, recognized through her co-authored papers and presentations at conferences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOUISE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Louise is a leading researcher known for her work in discovery and knowledge pursuit, currently reviewing her schedule."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT CHAIR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Department Chair is a position held by Dr. Eric Thompson, responsible for discussions and collaborations within the department."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SYMPOSIUM ON NEUROPLASTICITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Symposium on Neuroplasticity is an upcoming event discussed by Louise and Dr. Eric Thompson."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IC NOTES AND DIAGRAMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ic notes and diagrams refer to the workspace where Louise is currently working, symbolizing her domain of research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
